{"ID":"20240504170632-72moxwa","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240504170632-72moxwa","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170632-72moxwa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170632-qumbgdy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611174836-trufgko\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170632-qumbgdy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"200王孙","updated":"20240625161836"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240504170632-qumbgdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240504170632-qumbgdy","updated":"20240625161836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240611174914-mvbm25h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174914-mvbm25h"}},{"ID":"20240611175038-yh8nii4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611175038-yh8nii4","updated":"20240611175043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611175038-pyo327s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175038-pyo327s","updated":"20240611175038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175038-1a7ix3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175038-1a7ix3h","updated":"20240611175038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五臧邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175038-iw1jnvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175038-iw1jnvl","updated":"20240611175038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：黄孙一名王孙，一名蔓延，一名公草，一名海孙，神农雷公苦无毒。黄帝甘无毒，生西海山谷，及汝南城郭垣下，蔓延，赤文，茎叶相当。（《御览》）"}]},{"ID":"20240611175038-dff99ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175038-dff99ku","updated":"20240611175038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，一名海孙，一名蔓延，生海西及汝南城郭下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175038-1818wsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175038-1818wsh","updated":"20240611175038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案陶宏景云：今方家皆呼王昏，又云壮蒙。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175101-p745j3n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611175101-p745j3n","updated":"20240611175101"}},{"ID":"20240611175101-4njv74o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611175101-4njv74o","updated":"20240611175101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611175101-nweswqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175101-nweswqs","updated":"20240611175101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛，疗百病，益气。吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，一名海孙，一名蔓延。生海西川谷及汝南城郭垣下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175101-ua0dv3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175101-ua0dv3y","updated":"20240611175101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今方家皆呼名黄昏，又云牡蒙，市人亦少识者。唐本注云∶《短剧》述本草牡蒙，一名王孙。《药对》∶有牡蒙无王孙。此则一物明矣。又主金疮，破血，生肌肉，止痛，赤白痢，补虚益气，除脚肿，发阴阳也。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本注云∶叶似及己而大，根长尺余，皮、肉亦紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175144-4a7afva","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611175144-4a7afva"}},{"ID":"20240611175146-zpx2p12","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611175146-zpx2p12","updated":"20240611175150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611175146-konn48h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175146-konn48h","updated":"20240611175146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平，无毒。疗百疾，补虚益气。主五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢酸疼膝冷，痢疾，金疮破血，生肌止痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175224-oz5kd3t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611175224-oz5kd3t"}},{"ID":"20240611175225-9309dqo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611175225-9309dqo","updated":"20240611175235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611175225-1590xt1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175225-1590xt1","updated":"20240611175225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主治五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。治百病，益气。吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，一名海孙，一名蔓延。生海西川谷及汝南城郭垣下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175225-i5i3gre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175225-i5i3gre","updated":"20240611175225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今方家皆呼名黄昏，又云牡蒙，市人亦少识者。（《大观》卷九，《政和》二三七页）爵床，味咸，寒，无毒。主治腰脊痛，不得着床，俯仰艰难，除热，可作浴汤。生汉中川谷及田野。"}]},{"ID":"20240611175103-468aott","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611175103-468aott"}},{"ID":"20240611175108-surl6vh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611175108-surl6vh","updated":"20240611175112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611175108-nk7ifl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611175108-nk7ifl7","updated":"20240611175108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。疗百病，益气。吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，一名海孙，一名蔓延。生海西川谷及汝南城郭垣下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174914-2rewubm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174914-2rewubm"}},{"ID":"20240611174915-ogzkauv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174915-ogzkauv","updated":"20240611174919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174915-lefdq1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174915-lefdq1w","updated":"20240611174915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛，疗百病，益气。吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，一名海孙，一名蔓延。生海西川谷及汝南城郭垣下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174915-01f1e41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174915-01f1e41","updated":"20240611174915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今方家皆呼名黄昏，又云牡蒙，市人亦少识者。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174915-kskqrou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174915-kskqrou","updated":"20240611174915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《短剧》述本草牡蒙，一名王孙。《药对》有牡蒙，无王孙。此则一物明矣。又主金疮破血，生肌肉，止痛，赤白痢，补虚益气，除脚肿，发阴阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174832-dnzoupi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174832-dnzoupi"}},{"ID":"20240611174902-quho4vl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174902-quho4vl","updated":"20240611174909"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174902-vtphckh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174902-vtphckh","updated":"20240611174902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，平，无毒。主治五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。治百病，益气。吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，一名海孙，一名蔓延。生海西川谷及汝南城郭垣下。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174902-5xo4vse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174902-5xo4vse","updated":"20240611174902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今方家皆呼名黄昏，又云牡蒙，市人亦少识者。（《大观》卷九，《政和》二三七页）爵床，味咸，寒，无毒。主治腰脊痛，不得着床，俯仰艰难，除热，可作浴汤。生汉中川谷及田野。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174832-yr5iiqg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174832-yr5iiqg"}},{"ID":"20240611174842-8sx1hsg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174842-8sx1hsg","updated":"20240611174855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"王孙《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174842-w0s6vul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174842-w0s6vul","updated":"20240611174842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．主治百病，益气．吴名白功草，楚名王孙，齐名长孙，一名黄孙，一名黄昏，名海孙，一名蔓延．生海西及汝南城郭垣下．"}]},{"ID":"20240611174842-h2u23ll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174842-h2u23ll","updated":"20240611174842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶王孙，味苦，平．主五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240611174833-su8l3gj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174833-su8l3gj"}},{"ID":"20240611174834-k9raa1s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-k9raa1s","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：王孙"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-10yrp11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-10yrp11","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-u1qun02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-u1qun02","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Wánɡ Sūn"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-qatvd12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-qatvd12","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-bcw6t3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-bcw6t3j","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 白功草、长孙、黄孙、黄昏、海孙、蔓延（《别录》），牡蒙（陶弘景），早藕（《本草拾遗，），百节藕（《植物名实图考》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-rj0a1bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-rj0a1bt","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-zwxpd03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-zwxpd03","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-ygbhm1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-ygbhm1l","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-51upyti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-51upyti","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为百合科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四叶王孙"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。白露至霜降间挖取，去净苗叶，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-xeapozq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-xeapozq","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-inausru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-inausru","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于山地。分布江苏、浙江、安徽、江西、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-iq7k8ke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-iq7k8ke","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-7g5pqor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-7g5pqor","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本。根茎匍匐状，粗壮而长，有节。茎单1，直立，高约30厘米，单叶，通常4叶轮生于茎顶；叶片广椭圆形，先端尖，基部楔形，全缘，无柄。花单生于叶轮之上，具长柄；外列花被4瓣，淡黄绿色，广披针形，先端反卷，萼片状；内列花被4瓣，线形；雄蕊8枚，花丝细长，花药基部着生，长形；子房上位，球形，花柱4枚。肉质浆果，紫黑色，室背开裂。花期夏季。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-piue6k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-piue6k9","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-x8vl8dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-x8vl8dx","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-j71gmro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-j71gmro","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-v2dq9ce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-v2dq9ce","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《吴普本草》：\"神农、雷公：苦，无毒。黄帝：甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-qondgtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-qondgtp","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-9mptlyt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-9mptlyt","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 治痹症四肢酸疼，赤白痢疾。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-yokn2ua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-yokn2ua","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"治五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-npc2bn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-npc2bn6","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"益气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-8jvs285","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-8jvs285","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"主金疮，破血，生肌肉，止痛，赤白痢，补虚益气，除脚肿，发阴疡。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-f4pnjif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-f4pnjif","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《植物名实图考》：\"治虚劳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-y31pbkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-y31pbkp","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-kuex33y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-kuex33y","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-y72r535","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-y72r535","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：王孙"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-5s3fszy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-5s3fszy","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-jvtirjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-jvtirjj","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Wánɡ Sūn"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-w6jjarp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-w6jjarp","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-x38spmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-x38spmw","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 长孙、海孙、白功草、蔓延、黄孙、黄昏、杜蒙、露水一颗珠、露水珠、清水珠、七叶一枝花"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-rbbyr3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-rbbyr3i","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-dktvbj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-dktvbj7","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" rhizome of Fourleaf paris"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-l4y299z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-l4y299z","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-9t0oztv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-9t0oztv","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-1j45m2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-1j45m2u","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》：《小品》述本草牡蒙一名王孙，《药对》有牡蒙无王孙，此则一物明矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-3yayoac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-3yayoac","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《蜀本草》：王孙，叶似及己而大，根长尺余，皮肉亦紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-y46088h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-y46088h","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：王孙，叶生颠顶，似紫河车叶。按神农及吴普《本草》，紫参一名牡蒙。陶弘景亦曰，今方家呼紫参为牡蒙，其王孙并无牡蒙之名，而陶氏于王孙下，乃云又名牡蒙，且无形状。唐苏恭始以紫参、牡蒙为二物，谓紫参叶似羊蹄，王孙"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-gs40li8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-gs40li8","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-y7mastv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-y7mastv","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为百合科植物巴山重楼的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-jlv5mzp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-jlv5mzp","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Paris bashanensis Wang et Tang[P.quadrifolia L.var.setchuanensis Franch.]"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-sttudse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-sttudse","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季采挖，除去茎叶及须根，洗净，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-b7n0o2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-b7n0o2t","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-qt43dqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-qt43dqu","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于林下荫处。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-eg9ib8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-eg9ib8g","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于湖北、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-0u6opbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-0u6opbs","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-zkfr1h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-zkfr1h7","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 巴山重楼 多年生直立草本，高25-45cm。根茎细长而横生，直径4-8mm。叶4枚轮生，稀为5枚；叶片长圆状披针形或卵状椭圆形，长4-9cm，宽2-3.5cm，先端渐尖，基部楔形，具短柄或无柄。花梗长2-7cm；外轮花被片4，狭披针形，长1.5-3cm，宽3-4cm，反折；内轮花被片线形，与外轮同数且近等长；雄蕊通常8，花药长1- 1.2cm，花丝短，药隔突出部分长6-10mm；子房球形，花柱4-5分枝。浆果状蒴果不开裂，紫色；种子多数。花期4月。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-84xisuw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-84xisuw","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-xog2xvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-xog2xvz","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 根茎较细长，直径2-4mm，近等粗。表面灰棕色或棕褐色，节间较长。断面粉性。气微，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-cjsvrj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-cjsvrj4","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-29edhsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-29edhsa","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦；辛；温"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-hnyjqtn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-hnyjqtn","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-n86h50h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-n86h50h","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 散寒祛湿；通络止痛；止血生肌。主寒湿久痹，腰肢冷痛，外伤出血"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-um491ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-um491ln","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-tm9pcrm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-tm9pcrm","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，3-9g。外用：适量，捣敷：或研末撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-7ztnx5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-7ztnx5u","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-7tvdpx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-7tvdpx1","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：治五脏邪气，寒湿痹，四肢疼酸，膝冷痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-h4zbry2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-h4zbry2","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-q8l345y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-q8l345y","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：主金疮，破血，生肌肉，止痛，赤白痢，补虚益气，除脚肿，发阴疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-o9kvntb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-o9kvntb","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《植物名实图考》：治虚劳。"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-pt9ldym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-pt9ldym","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240611174834-r29pw3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174834-r29pw3z","updated":"20240611174834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611174835-ucggbdy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611174835-ucggbdy"}},{"ID":"20240611174836-trufgko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611174836-trufgko"}}]}